# Allow-list: the build context should contain ONLY the files this image
# actually COPYs. Everything else (devcontainer.json, editor cruft, future
# local files) is excluded so it can't leak into a layer or bust the cache.
#
# Ignore everything, then un-ignore exactly what the Dockerfile COPYs.
*
!starship.toml
!postcreate.sh
!fix-ownership.sh
